            aboutTagline: 'Connecting travelers with the world from Panama',
            aboutQueEs: 'What is KAVARI?',
            aboutDesc1: 'KAVARI is a digital smart tourism platform that connects travelers with real information, certified guides, and destinations around the world. Our mission is to make planning a trip a simple, reliable, and exciting experience.',
            aboutDesc2: 'We were born with the idea that traveling should not be complicated. With KAVARI, users have access to updated information on destinations, airlines, accommodations, gastronomy, culture, and much more, all in one place.',
            aboutMisionLabel: 'Our Mission',
            aboutMision: 'Mission',
            aboutMisionText: 'To facilitate access to quality tourism information, connecting travelers with certified local guides and providing digital tools that transform the way the world moves, safely, accessibly, and excitingly.',
            aboutVisionLabel: 'Our Vision',
            aboutVision: 'Vision',
