            faqViajerosTitulo: 'Frequently Asked Questions — Travelers',
            faqGuiasTitulo: 'Frequently Asked Questions — Tour Guides',
            faqPlataformaTitulo: 'Frequently Asked Questions — The Platform',
            faqPaquetesTitulo: 'Frequently Asked Questions — Travel Packages',

            faq1q: 'How do I search for a tourist destination on KAVARI?',
            faq1a: 'On the Destinations page you will find the 21 countries available on KAVARI. You can use the search box at the top to filter by country or city name. Click on "View destination" to access all the tourist information for that country: culture, gastronomy, adventure, airlines, accommodations, and more.',
            faq2q: 'Can I hire a tour guide from KAVARI?',
            faq2a: 'Yes. Within each country page you will find the "Tour Guides" section where certified guides available for that destination are listed. Filter by level (Diamond, Gold, Silver) and click "Hire" to send your request directly to the guide.',
            faq3q: 'Are the prices shown final?',
            faq3a: 'Airline and accommodation prices are reference prices for mid-season. Final prices may vary depending on dates, availability, and flight origin. When you click "Book flight" or "Book stay" you will be redirected directly to the airline or accommodation to confirm the final price.',
            faq4q: 'What practical information can I find about each country?',
            faq4a: 'In the "Practical Info" section of each country you will find: local currency, official language, visas and required documents, transportation, Wi-Fi connectivity, best seasons to travel, and suggested itinerary. You can also use the AI Assistant to ask specific questions about the destination.',
            faq5q: 'How does the KAVARI AI Assistant work?',
            faq5a: 'Each country page has a chatbot specialized in that destination. You can ask about weather, visas, safety, gastronomy, costs, transportation, emergencies, and more. The assistant responds with specific information about the selected country. Use the predefined suggestions to get started or type your own question.',
            faq6q: 'How do I register as a tour guide on KAVARI?',
            faq6a: 'Click the "I\'m a Guide" button on the main page or go to the Guides section and select "Join as a guide". Complete your profile with name, description, languages, specialties, city, and country where you operate. Select your membership level (Silver, Gold, or Diamond) and make the payment to activate your profile.',
            faq7q: 'What are the differences between Silver, Gold, and Diamond levels?',
            faq7a: '<strong>Silver ($20/month):</strong> Standard visibility in guide listings. <br><strong>Gold ($35/month):</strong> Higher positioning in search results, featured profile. <br><strong>Diamond ($50/month):</strong> Maximum priority in listings, special badge, appears first to travelers. Diamond and Gold guides appear before Silver ones.',
            faq8q: 'In which countries can I register as a guide?',
            faq8a: 'You can register as a guide for any of the 21 destinations available on KAVARI. When selecting your country during registration, your profile will automatically appear in the "Tour Guides" section of that country. If you operate in multiple countries, you can create separate profiles for each one.',
            faq9q: 'What payment methods does KAVARI accept?',
            faq9a: 'For guide membership payments we accept: Yappy (Panama mobile banking), Bank transfer (Banco General, BAC, Banistmo), and Credit/Debit card (Visa, Mastercard, American Express). All payments are protected with SSL encryption.',
            faq10q: 'What languages is KAVARI available in?',
            faq10a: 'KAVARI is available in Spanish, English, and Portuguese. You can change the language at any time using the language selector (<i class="fa-solid fa-globe" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:.9em;vertical-align:middle;"></i> icon) available in the navigation bar of all pages. Your preference is automatically saved for your next visit.',
            faq11q: 'How do I activate dark mode?',
            faq11a: 'Click the <i class="fa-solid fa-moon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:.9em;vertical-align:middle;"></i> icon on any KAVARI navigation bar to activate dark mode. You can also click the <i class="fa-solid fa-sun" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:.9em;vertical-align:middle;"></i> icon to return to light mode. Your preference is automatically saved and applied across all pages of the platform.',
            faq12q: 'How does the platform tutorial work?',
            faq12a: 'The interactive tutorial appears automatically the first time you visit KAVARI. It guides you step by step through all the platform features with pop-up messages, arrows, and examples. If you want to see it again, click the "Tutorial" button on the main menu on the homepage.',
            faq13q: 'What does a KAVARI travel package include?',
            faq13a: 'Each package is different, but generally includes: international flight (on international packages), 3 or 4-star hotel, airport-hotel transfers, certified tour guide, daily breakfast, and entry to main attractions. Click "View details" on any package to see exactly what that itinerary includes.',
            faq14q: 'Can I book directly from KAVARI?',
            faq14a: 'Currently KAVARI works as an information platform and tourist directory. When you click "Book now" you will be directed to view the full destination to coordinate with local guides. For flight and hotel bookings, the links redirect you directly to the airlines and Airbnb. For complete packages, contact us through the Contact form.',

