paisColombia_souvenirs_0_productos_2_descripcion: 'Reproduction of pieces from the Gold Museum. Shows the goldsmithing of Quimbaya, Muisca, and Zenú cultures.',
paisColombia_souvenirs_0_productos_3_nombre: 'Fique Bag',
paisColombia_souvenirs_0_productos_3_descripcion: 'Bag woven with fique fiber, a natural material from the Andean region. Ecological and durable.',
