paisColombia_souvenirs_1_descripcion: 'Across from the Cartagena square, this portal offers vueltiao hats, emerald jewelry, and typical sweets from the Caribbean region.',
paisColombia_souvenirs_1_productos_0_nombre: 'Vueltiao Hat',
paisColombia_souvenirs_1_productos_0_descripcion: 'Woven in caña flecha by artisans from the Caribbean region. National symbol of Colombia. The best come from Sincelejo.',
