paisPeru_gastronomia_platos_7_categoria: 'Jungle · Tradition',
paisPeru_gastronomia_platos_7_descripcion: 'Rice with chicken, olives, eggs, and spices, wrapped in bijao leaves and cooked.',
paisPeru_gastronomia_platos_7_nota: 'Celebration of San Juan Bautista (June 24)',

