paisRepublicaDominicana_souvenirs_0_productos_3_descripcion: 'Dominican tobacco cigar, one of the best in the world. Handmade with leaves from the Santiago region.',
paisRepublicaDominicana_souvenirs_0_productos_4_nombre: 'Caribbean Landscape Painting',
paisRepublicaDominicana_souvenirs_0_productos_4_descripcion: 'Oils and acrylics by local artists depicting Dominican beaches, palm trees, and sunsets.',

