paisArgentina_nombre: 'Argentina',
paisArgentina_subtitulo: 'Immense',
paisArgentina_tagline: 'Country of contrasts, culture, and infinite landscapes',
paisArgentina_descripcion: 'Argentina is at the southern tip of South America and is the largest Spanish-speaking country in the world. It has an area of 3,761,274 km², a population of 46,234,830 according to the 2022 Census, capital in Buenos Aires, peso currency, and official GMT−3 time zone.',
