paisArgentina_practica_temporadas_0_descripcion: 'Ideal for Patagonia and beaches. Heat in north and center. More tourists.',
paisArgentina_practica_temporadas_1_nombre: 'High season (winter)',
paisArgentina_practica_temporadas_1_descripcion: 'Ideal for snow in Bariloche, Mendoza, and Las Leñas. Cold weather.',
paisArgentina_practica_temporadas_2_nombre: 'Recommended',
