paisArgentina_souvenirs_1_productos_2_descripcion: 'Carved wooden spoon from lengue, a native tree of Patagonia. Durable and artisan design.',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_1_productos_3_nombre: 'Silver and Stone Bracelet',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_1_productos_3_descripcion: 'Silver bracelet with stones from the Andean region: rhodochrosite, lapis lazuli, and agate.',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_1_productos_4_nombre: 'Mapuche Ceramic Ornament',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_1_productos_4_descripcion: 'Mapuche ceramic figure with traditional geometric designs. Symbol of the ancestral culture of Patagonia.',

paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_nombre: 'Artisan Fair - Salta',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_descripcion: 'Craft fair in downtown Salta. Leather, ceramics, and textiles from northwestern Argentina.',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_productos_0_nombre: 'Vicuña Poncho',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_productos_0_descripcion: 'Vicuña wool poncho, the finest fabric in the world. Ancestral technique of Andean artisans.',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_productos_1_nombre: 'Andean Ceramic Figure',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_productos_1_descripcion: 'Ceramic figure with Diaguita and Calchaquí designs. Natural colors and geometric motifs.',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_productos_2_nombre: 'Llama Leather Bag',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_productos_2_descripcion: 'Llama leather bag, resistant and lightweight. Designs with braids and embroidery from the region.',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_productos_3_nombre: 'Chañar Seed Necklace',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_productos_3_descripcion: 'Necklace of chañar seeds, a tree from northern Argentina. Woven with colored threads and artisan technique.',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_productos_4_nombre: 'Wooden Condor',
paisArgentina_souvenirs_2_productos_4_descripcion: 'Andean condor sculpture carved in quebracho wood. Symbol of the nature of northwestern Argentina.',

