paisBrasil_gastronomia_titulo: 'Gastronomy of Brazil',
paisBrasil_gastronomia_descripcion: 'Brazilian cuisine varies greatly by region. It uses rice, beans, meats, cassava (yucca), fish, tropical fruits, and local spices. A cuisine as diverse as its territory.',
