paisBrasil_gastronomia_platos_3_descripcion: 'Fried bean ball in palm oil, stuffed with shrimp, vatapá, and caruru. Typical food from Bahia.',
paisBrasil_gastronomia_platos_3_nota: 'Offered by acarajé baianas',

