// ===== CHILE =====
paisChile_nombre: 'Chile',
paisChile_subtitulo: 'Southern',
paisChile_tagline: 'A long, diverse country full of unique landscapes',
paisChile_descripcion: 'Chile is in South America and extends along the western edge of the continent, between the Andes Mountains and the Pacific Ocean. It has an area of 756,700 km², a population of 19,764,771 (2024), capital in Santiago, Chilean peso currency, and time zone UTC−3 to UTC−6 depending on the region.',
