// Airlines
paisEcuador_aerolineas_0_descripcion: 'The airline with the largest network in Ecuador and South America. Connections throughout the country, the Americas, and Europe. Hubs in Quito and Guayaquil.',
paisEcuador_aerolineas_1_descripcion: 'Colombian airline with a strong presence in Ecuador. Connections to Colombia, Peru, and the entire region.',
paisEcuador_aerolineas_2_descripcion: 'Ecuadorian airline with flights to Galápagos, the coast, and the Amazon. Competitive fares and local service.',
paisEcuador_aerolineas_3_descripcion: 'Direct flights from Miami and Dallas to Quito and Guayaquil. Connections throughout Ecuador and South America.',
paisEcuador_aerolineas_4_descripcion: 'Connections via Panama to all of Latin America. The Hub of the Americas connects to all Copa destinations.',

