paisCuba_practica_infoCards_1_texto: 'José Martí Airport (HAV) in Havana. Juan Gualberto Gómez Airport (VRA) in Varadero.',
paisCuba_practica_infoCards_2_titulo: 'Climate',
paisCuba_practica_infoCards_2_texto: 'Tropical, warm, and humid: 22-32°C. Hurricane season: June-November.',
