paisVenezuela_gastronomia_platos_8_descripcion: 'Abundant soup of meats (beef, chicken, fish) with cassava, plantain, potato, corn, and vegetables. A dish to share.',
paisVenezuela_gastronomia_platos_8_nota: 'Popular on Sundays',

