paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_0_nombre: 'Visit to Angel Falls',
paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_0_descripcion: 'Curiara excursion from Canaima to see the world\'s highest waterfall. Natural pools. Navigation on the Carrao River.',
paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_1_nombre: 'Diving and snorkeling in Los Roques',
paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_1_descripcion: 'Coral reefs, turquoise waters, sea turtles, manta rays. World-class diving in one of the best-preserved national parks in the Caribbean.',
paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_2_nombre: 'Excursion to Canaima',
paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_2_descripcion: 'UNESCO World Heritage National Park. Tepuis, lagoons, unique landscapes. Gateway to Angel Falls.',
paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_3_nombre: 'Hiking in Mérida',
paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_3_descripcion: 'Mukumbarí Cable Car (the highest and longest in the world). Ascent to Pico Bolívar (4,978 m). Paragliding and rafting.',
paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_4_nombre: 'Tours through the Llanos',
paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_4_descripcion: 'Sightings of capybaras, caimans, anacondas, babas. 4x4 and boat tours. One of the highest concentrations of wildlife in South America.',
paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_5_nombre: 'Beach tourism in Morrocoy and Los Roques',
paisVenezuela_aventura_actividades_5_descripcion: 'Morrocoy: crystal-clear water cays and mangroves. Los Roques: dream archipelago. White sand beaches and Caribbean sun.',

paisVenezuela_aventura_darkBand_titulo: 'Country of the world\'s highest waterfall',
paisVenezuela_aventura_darkBand_texto: 'Venezuela has the world\'s highest waterfall (Angel Falls, 979 m), the highest peak in Venezuela (Pico Bolívar, 4,978 m), 43 national parks, 2,800 km of Caribbean coast, 30-million-year-old tepuis, and the plains with one of the highest concentrations of wildlife in South America.',
