paisUruguay_aventura_titulo: 'Adventure & Nature in Uruguay',
paisUruguay_aventura_descripcion: 'Uruguay offers extensive coasts (660 km), quiet beaches, hot springs, nature reserves, gentle mountains (Cerro Catedral 514 m), and rural landscapes ideal for quiet and restful trips.',
