paisUruguay_aventura_darkBand_titulo: 'Switzerland of America',
paisUruguay_aventura_darkBand_texto: 'Uruguay is known as the \'Switzerland of America\' for its political stability, institutions, low corruption, and quality of life. It has the world\'s highest meat consumption per capita and the longest carnival on the planet (40 days).',
