paisHonduras_subtitulo: 'Island',
paisHonduras_tagline: 'Land of islands, Mayan culture, and Caribbean beaches',
paisHonduras_descripcion: 'Honduras is in the heart of Central America and stands out for its natural richness, Mayan ruins, and Caribbean beaches. It has capital in Tegucigalpa, lempira currency, and official language Spanish.',
