paisHonduras_aventura_actividades_0_nombre: 'Diving in Roatán and Utila',
paisHonduras_aventura_actividades_0_descripcion: 'Mesoamerican Reef (second largest in the world). Whale sharks in Utila (March-April, August-September). Snorkeling in Cayos Cochinos.',
paisHonduras_aventura_actividades_1_nombre: 'Visit to Copán',
paisHonduras_aventura_actividades_1_descripcion: 'UNESCO Mayan ruins. Hieroglyphic Stairway. Archaeological tunnel. Maya Sculpture Museum.',
paisHonduras_aventura_actividades_2_nombre: 'Rafting on the Cangrejal River',
paisHonduras_aventura_actividades_2_descripcion: 'Class III-IV rafting near La Ceiba. Jungle, waterfalls, and canyons. For experienced adventurers.',
paisHonduras_aventura_actividades_3_nombre: 'Hiking in Pico Bonito',
paisHonduras_aventura_actividades_3_descripcion: 'National Park with tropical rainforest. Trails to waterfalls (El Bejuco, Zacate). Birds (quetzal, toucan, macaw).',
paisHonduras_aventura_actividades_4_nombre: 'Beaches in the Bay Islands',
paisHonduras_aventura_actividades_4_descripcion: 'West Bay (Roatán). White sand beaches and turquoise waters. Snorkeling from the shore. Relaxation.',
