// Adventure
paisBelice_aventura_titulo: 'Adventure & Nature in Belize',
paisBelice_aventura_descripcion: 'Belize offers the Mesoamerican Reef (second largest in the world), tropical rainforests (Cockscomb Jaguar Reserve), rivers for cave tubing, mountains, and cays.',
